<title>USA: Reckson forms joint venture, gets options.</title>
<headline>Reckson forms joint venture, gets options.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckson Associates Realty Corp said Tuesday it formed a joint venture with Matrix Development Group and acquired options to buy about 400 acres of land in New Jersey known as the Northeast Business Park.</p>
<p>Reckson said the joint venture plans to develop Northeast Business Park, on which about 4.7 million square feet of commercial space can be built. Its plans represents more than $200 million of development projects, the company said.</p>
<p>The joint venture will also pursue additional development and acquisition opportunities of industrial properties in northern and central New Jersey, Reckson said.  </p>
<p>Matrix is an industrial developer in New Jersey.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
